        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "First-party homegrown RC4 (Arcfour) implementation shipped as a reusable library: key-schedule at arcfour.c:16 and stream generation at arcfour.c:33, exported API in arcfour.h, and a live known-answer test (arcfour_test.c:34-35) that genuinely runs the cipher on published vectors. RC4 is broken classically (keystream bias, RC4-drop attacks) independent of quantum computing; replace with AES-256-GCM or ChaCha20-Poly1305. Changeable here — this repo is the product itself."
